going, what you doing, Daddy?

00:01:08.552 --> 00:01:11.070
No, oh yeah, I'm just building this.

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:11.903
I'll help you.

00:01:11.903 --> 00:01:12.770
No, no, I'm okay.

