00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:25.840
hmm, time's being taken
away from just focus on me?

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:26.673
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:26.673 --> 00:01:27.680
- Oh yeah, oh yeah. Yeah.
She's doing that definitely

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:28.730
and anytime that it's brought up,

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:31.990
suddenly she's on the bump,
kind of lying on it going,

00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:33.410
what was that? Talking about me or this?

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:35.311
Oh, it's okay and kind
of covering it, you know?

00:01:35.311 --> 00:01:36.144
(Kelly laughs and claps)

00:01:36.144 --> 00:01:37.740
