- [Kelly] Winnie-the-Pooh!

00:01:52.167 --> 00:01:54.167
- [Jessica] I have the
biggest crush on him

00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:55.836
and that he's very cute

00:01:55.836 --> 00:01:58.019
and he's the best actor ever in Titanic.

00:01:58.019 --> 00:01:59.228
(whooshing sound)

00:01:59.228 --> 00:02:00.715
(Kelly laughs and audience claps)

00:02:00.715 --> 00:02:02.316
- I love this!

00:02:02.316 --> 00:02:05.490
So this is my favorite
thing we've ever shown.

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:07.970
That DiCaprio fan
interviewed was your wife.

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:11.650
- My wife, yeah, on Extra
