I did maybe spend a couple of extra nights

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:24.070
in the spare room.

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:25.106
- Yeah.

00:02:25.106 --> 00:02:26.550
- I just love the fact that
it's Winnie-the-Pooh and Leo.

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:27.579
Kind of-

