00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:32.950
he could have played Christopher Robin.

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:33.783
I'm just saying.

00:02:33.783 --> 00:02:35.040
- He could still.

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:35.873
He's that good.

00:02:35.873 --> 00:02:37.980
- He's that good. He could
still play Christopher Robin.

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:39.440
- A man version.

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:42.244
So we're all very excited
for the new Downton movie.

00:02:42.244 --> 00:02:43.077
- Great.

00:02:43.077 --> 00:02:43.910
- So when did you realize

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:46.220
that the show had become
as huge as it did?

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:48.830
- I think it was the first
season had come out in the UK.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:50.200
Hadn't come out in the States yet

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.000
and I was back in Ireland doing a play.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:53.575
So I'd missed all kind of the big...

00:02:53.575 --> 00:02:55.975
everyone talking, all the buzz.

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:56.808
- Yeah.

00:02:56.808 --> 00:02:58.980
- I was on the Tube on
the underground in London

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:01.750
going back to meet all the
cast to watch the final episode

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:04.746
and I got on and I noticed
the whole carriage went-

00:03:04.746 --> 00:03:05.960
(Allen makes shoosh sound)

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.713
And someone very unsubtly went,

00:03:08.655 --> 00:03:10.350
the driver, the driver.

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:11.610
(Kelly laughs)

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:13.030
And everyone was, oh yeah, it's the driver

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:15.350
and then okay, it's kind of weird.

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:16.183
Got off and-

00:03:16.183 --> 00:03:17.400
- And my character has a name.

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.524
- Yeah, it's Tom. Tom Branson.

00:03:19.524 --> 00:03:20.357
(beep sound)

00:03:20.357 --> 00:03:21.553
- I am more than the driver.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:24.920
- But it was really bizarre

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:26.880
and then I walked out of the of the Tube

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.310
and was just walking down the street

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:30.910
and about 10 more people
were like driver, driver.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:31.743
- Oh my God.

00:03:31.743 --> 00:03:33.604
- Like all I'm missing
is the car, you know?

00:03:33.604 --> 00:03:34.670
(Kelly and Allen laughs)

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:35.503
- That's amazing.

00:03:35.503 --> 00:03:36.336
So, what your character

00:03:36.336 --> 00:03:38.060
was only supposed to be in a few episodes.

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.300
- Three episodes in the first season.

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:40.550
- Yeah, they loved you that much.

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:41.383
- Well, I don't know,

00:03:41.383 --> 00:03:44.390
but I think it was Julian
Fellowes, the writer decided,

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.610
I've got some good ideas
with the Irish character,

00:03:46.610 --> 00:03:48.441
the chauffer and the lady of the house.

00:03:48.441 --> 00:03:49.274
- Yeah.

00:03:49.274 --> 00:03:50.107
- So yeah.

00:03:50.107 --> 00:03:51.243
- I'm glad that the ideas were there.

00:03:51.243 --> 00:03:52.076
- So am I!

00:03:52.076 --> 00:03:52.909
(Allen laughs)

00:03:52.909 --> 00:03:54.521
- Yeah. I mean, not just for
you but for us. We love you.

00:03:54.521 --> 00:03:55.562
- Aww, thank you.

00:03:55.562 --> 00:03:56.395
- Yeah.

00:03:56.395 --> 00:03:57.761
(audience claps)

00:03:57.761 --> 00:03:58.594
- So now, focus of the new movie.

00:03:58.594 --> 00:03:59.427
How crazy is that?

00:03:59.427 --> 00:04:00.260
It's different now, right?

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:01.620
- Yeah. I mean, it was great.

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:03.290
My character went through
like a lot of heartache

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:06.180
and heartbreak and the movie
opens with his wedding.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.920
No spoilers cos it's in the trailer

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:10.720
but it's great that my character
finally finds happiness.

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:12.580
which is something that
I really wanted for him

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:13.610
and I think he deserved.

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:16.150
- Yeah. Agreed. Well, it's
time for a quick break.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:19.541
Everybody, Downton Abbey, A
New Era, is in theaters now.

00:04:19.541 --> 00:04:21.403
